      "content": "{\"task_id\": \"v2-ticket-09-11\", \"workflow\": \"ticket\", \"ticket_id\": \"T-v2-ticket-09-11-0\", \"service_id\": \"S-v2-ticket-09-11-0\", \"goals\": [\"status\", \"owner\", \"note\"], \"structure\": \"chain_branch\", \"instructions\": \"Read tickets following parent_ticket_id from the requested ticket until null. Read the terminal ticket's service. If healthy, only resolve the terminal ticket. Otherwise follow its escalation_ticket_id, read that ticket, its service and policy, and only set owner and append the escalation ticket's diagnosis note.\", \"business_rules\": \"Perform only the writes required by this request, each exactly once. Read required data from tools; retry missing or incomplete reads. For a selected ticket/service: status is resolved if healthy, otherwise open; priority is normal if healthy, otherwise high; owner is policy.owner; note is diagnosis:{service_id}:{state}:{policy.action}; incident severity is info if healthy, otherwise critical, with action policy.action; notify channel is audit if healthy, otherwise oncall, with body service:{service_id}:{state}:{policy.action}. Severity order is outage > degraded > healthy. Do not write to unselected objects.\"}"
